WEBVTT

00:00:00.291 --> 00:00:02.716
Want a YouTube channel without being on camera?

00:00:02.957 --> 00:00:04.273
Start with a stick figure.

00:00:04.838 --> 00:00:06.079
No camera crew.

00:00:06.098 --> 00:00:07.724
No weeks of animation.

00:00:08.157 --> 00:00:09.407
Just a strong hook,

00:00:09.595 --> 00:00:10.000
a clear story,
